  payload-only, not bundled.
- CANONICAL-TRIGGER MINT: Category:<umbrella> is not a reliable "give me every X" source
  on this wiki — it silently mixes list/meta pages with real content pages and can omit
  real members from its own subcategories. Any future full-surface enumeration should
  budget for a 3-way union (umbrella category, minus known meta-page suffixes, union'd
  against the cleaner F2P/P2P-style subcategories) rather than trusting one members()
  call, and should verify a diary/achievement-style category exists before relying on it
  (Category:Achievement Diary returns empty; the real index is the article's own link list).

